<%- include('../partials/head', {
  pageTitle: 'Sponsor Wales Junior Golf — Wales Junior Golf',
  pageDescription: 'Support junior golf in Wales and put your business in front of golfing families across the country. Headline sponsor, supporter and partner packages.'
}) %>

<h1>Sponsor Wales Junior Golf</h1>
<p class="sponsor-lead">Wales Junior Golf lists every junior golf competition in Wales in one free place: junior opens, national tours and club events, searchable by region, county and age. Parents use it to plan their season; clubs use it to fill their fields. Sponsorship keeps it free for everyone.</p>

<div class="sponsor-reach">
  <div class="sponsor-stat"><p class="sponsor-stat-value"><%= reach.events %></p><p class="sponsor-stat-label">upcoming junior events listed</p></div>
  <div class="sponsor-stat"><p class="sponsor-stat-value"><%= reach.clubs %></p><p class="sponsor-stat-label">golf clubs across Wales</p></div>
  <div class="sponsor-stat"><p class="sponsor-stat-value">Page 1</p><p class="sponsor-stat-label">on Google for junior golf in Wales</p></div>
</div>

<h2>Packages</h2>
<div class="sponsor-packages">
  <div class="sponsor-package sponsor-package-main">
    <span class="sponsor-tag sponsor-tag-red">One only</span>
    <h3>Headline sponsor</h3>
    <p class="sponsor-price">£250 <span>a year</span></p>
    <p class="sponsor-note">Founding rate for the 2027 season</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your logo under the search bar on the home page</li>
      <li>Logo on our weekly social round-ups</li>
      <li>Featured in "Supported by"</li>
      <li>Thank-you posts on Facebook, Instagram and X</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="sponsor-package">
    <span class="sponsor-tag">Local business</span>
    <h3>Supporter</h3>
    <p class="sponsor-price">£50 <span>a year</span></p>
    <p class="sponsor-note">Ideal for pro shops and local firms</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your logo and link in "Supported by" on the home page</li>
      <li>Named in a welcome post on our social channels</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="sponsor-package">
    <span class="sponsor-tag">Organisations</span>
    <h3>Partner</h3>
    <p class="sponsor-price sponsor-price-text">By arrangement</p>
    <p class="sponsor-note">Tourism bodies, associations, councils</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Partner credit in "Supported by" and the site footer</li>
      <li>Joint promotion of events and golf in Wales</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="sponsor-where">
  <div class="sponsor-sketch" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="sk-bar"></div>
    <div class="sk-hero"></div>
    <div class="sk-headline">HEADLINE SPONSOR</div>
    <div class="sk-row"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
    <div class="sk-bar"></div>
    <div class="sk-row sk-supporters"><span></span><span></span><span class="sk-open"></span></div>
    <div class="sk-label">SUPPORTED BY</div>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2>Where you appear</h2>
    <p>The headline sponsor sits directly under the search bar on the home page, the first thing parents see. All sponsors and partners appear in the "Supported by" section of the home page, with a link to your website.</p>
    <p>Sponsorship runs for a season and renews each spring.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="cta-banner">
  <div>
    <p class="cta-title">Interested?</p>
    <p class="cta-sub">Email Brian at hello@walesjuniorgolf.co.uk and we'll get you set up.</p>
  </div>
  <a class="cta-button" href="mailto:hello@walesjuniorgolf.co.uk?subject=Sponsoring%20Wales%20Junior%20Golf">Get in touch</a>
</div>

